      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging system protect my belongings?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 7‑layer system starts with high‑density bubble wrap for cushioning, followed by multi‑ply corrugated sheets for rigidity, then heavy‑duty stretch film for weather protection, and finishes with custom wooden crates for delicate items like glassware or temple statues. Each layer adds shock absorption and moisture resistance, ensuring items arrive intact.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What should I expect at highway checkposts during the Madan‑to‑hub transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our drivers carry all necessary permits, e‑Way bills, and insurance documents. At each checkpost, they present these papers, pay any applicable tolls, and receive clearance. Real‑time GPS updates keep you informed of any delays, and our support team is on standby to resolve issues instantly.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I store my furniture temporarily if my new home isn’t ready?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. We offer secure, 24/7 CCTV‑monitored warehousing in both Madan and major destination hubs. Items are stored on pallets, wrapped in our 7‑layer system, and can be retrieved on short notice. Storage fees are transparent and billed hourly or daily based on your needs.</p>
